# Product Completion Directive v8

Read `docs/PRODUCT_COMPLETION_DIRECTIVE.md` and `docs/QUEUE_STATE.md` before every Task.

## Purpose

**Keep LaunchLens growing forever.** Not sprint completion. Not "project done."

## Never terminate

Queue empty → **generate next queue** → consume. Project has **no complete state.**

Queue generation criteria: UX · Ops efficiency · Quality · Perf · Code quality · Tech debt · AI PM experience.

## Vision guard (new queues)

- Prefer **improving existing Journey** over new features
- Must satisfy `docs/PRODUCT_VISION_V3.md` + North Star
- Do **not** add features that don't strengthen **AI Strategy Project Manager**

## Priority (repeat forever)

P0 outage → P1 Journey → P2 experience → P3 AI PM → P4 Admin → P5 Analytics → P6 Perf → P7 SEO → P8 A11y → P9 Responsive → P10 Refactor → P11 Docs → P12 DX → **P1 again**

## No time targets

Cursor does not use hours/sprints as termination. **Queue + evolution loop only.**

## Task standard

Feature + UX + Animation + States + Resilience + A11y + Responsive + SEO + Perf + Analytics + Admin + Docs + Regression + Deploy.

## Roles

Senior Product Engineer · QA · DevOps · SRE · Designer · Frontend Lead · Platform Engineer.

> 오늘보다 내일 더 좋아지게.

## Cycle

Implement → QA → Build → Commit → Push → Prod → Tag → QUEUE_STATE → **next Task**

## Stop (5)

Build fail · Prod outage · DB/LLM/Billing/Auth cost · Security · Vision change

## Forbidden output

완료했습니다 · 끝났습니다 · Queue 비었습니다 · 다음 작업 없습니다 · 승인 · 배포할까요

## Report

08:00 KST **Daily Product Evolution Report** only
